paper-sources/lehalleur-rimanyi-2024-geometry-of-dln-fibre/source/main.tex:638:The first consequence of Lemma \ref{lem:voight} is that a formula for the codimension of an orbit is a (non-symmetric) bilinear form, in the components of the Kostant partition. 
